{"title": "PM Modi highlights INS Mahendragiri as symbol of Atmanirbhar Bharat", "summary": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi addressed the 136th episode of his monthly radio programme, Mann Ki Baat. He highlighted the induction of INS Mahendragiri into the Indian Navy as an example of India's progress in indigenous defence manufacturing. The Prime Minister stated that INS Mahendragiri has been designed and made in India. This was mentioned during a discussion on India's achievements in space exploration and global recognition.", "summary_points": ["The 136th episode of Mann Ki Baat was addressed by Prime Minister Narendra Modi", "INS Mahendragiri was highlighted as an example of indigenous defence manufacturing"], "title_hi": "प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने अटमानीर्भर भारत का प्रतीक बनाए INS महेन्द्रगिरि", "summary_hi": "प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने अपने मासिक रेडियो कार्यक्रम मन्न की बात के 136वें एपिसोड में भारतीय नौसेना में शामिल होने वाले INS महेन्द्रगिरि को एक उदाहरण के रूप में उठाया। उन्होंने कहा कि यह आधुनिक युद्धक जहाज भारत में डिज़ाइन और बनाया गया था। इस बातचीत में भारतीय अंतरिक्ष अनुसंधान की उपलब्धियों और विश्व स्तर पर प्रतिष्ठा पर चर्चा हुई।", "summary_points_hi": ["136वें एपिसोड के लिए मन्न की बात का मुख्य भाग प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने दिया"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage largely reported the events without a distinct frame."}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132637027,imgsize-132923.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ins-mahendragiri-symbol-of-atmanirbhar-bharat-pm-modi-in-mann-ki-baat/articleshow/132637016.cms", "headline": "'INS Mahendragiri symbol of Atmanirbhar Bharat': PM Modi in Mann Ki Baat"}, {"source": "Telangana Today", "owner": "Telangana Today", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwF